Here's what each tool does:

gt_pm_status: Shows a project snapshot for "goldthread" mode - lists recent actions taken, active AI goals/threads you've set up, current context window usage (how much memory the model has about ongoing work). Useful to review what happened in an automation session. Think of it as reviewing your own action history.

gt_selfcheck: Validates critical goldthread infrastructure:
- Thesis file exists and is read-only (goldthread locks this)  
- Hooks are registered properly
- Ledger ledger writable

This runs after Hermes upgrades or when something about goldthread's core config feels broken. It won't help with profile errors in regular tools though.



